  "goodToKnow": "Sofortig means immediate and is used before nouns: eine sofortige Entscheidung, mit sofortiger Wirkung (with immediate effect), a phrase in resignations and dismissals. As an adverb, German uses sofort: Komm sofort her! (come here right now!). Similarly, Sofortmaßnahmen are emergency measures, and the Sofortüberweisung is an instant bank transfer. From so + fort (at once). Its typical companions are Rücktritt, Kündigung and Waffenstillstand."
